---
description: Read browser/UI constraints before editing the vanilla web client
globs: web_client/**/*
alwaysApply: false
---

Before adding or editing files under **`web_client/`** (including HTML/CSS/vanilla ES modules tied to this client), **read [`docs/web-client-browser-constraints.md`](docs/web-client-browser-constraints.md)** and follow those constraints.

Also read **[`docs/web-client-layout-contract.md`](docs/web-client-layout-contract.md)** when changing shell layout.

For user-visible chrome copy, extend **[`web_client/js/ui_strings.js`](web_client/js/ui_strings.js)** for **en / fr / es / pt / hi** rather than embedding English literals.
